        <mxCell id="uP7TciB98O3cOZ6XCzb7-14" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:20px&quot;&gt;\(&#xa;\begin{aligned}&#xa;&amp;amp;\textbf{Chain Rule}\\[4pt]&#xa;&amp;amp;\text{Backpropagation applies the chain rule from right to left.}\\[6pt]&#xa;&amp;amp;x \longrightarrow u \longrightarrow J&#xa;\qquad\Rightarrow\qquad&#xa;\frac{\partial J}{\partial x}&#xa;=&#xa;\frac{\partial J}{\partial u}&#xa;\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}.\\[8pt]&#xa;&amp;amp;J&#xa;\longrightarrow z^{[3]}&#xa;\longrightarrow a^{[2]}&#xa;\longrightarrow z^{[2]}&#xa;\longrightarrow a^{[1]}&#xa;\longrightarrow z^{[1]}.\\[8pt]&#xa;&amp;amp;\boxed{&#xa;\delta^{[l]}&#xa;:=&#xa;\frac{\partial J}{\partial z^{[l]}}&#xa;}\\[4pt]&#xa;&amp;amp;\delta^{[l]}&#xa;\text{ measures the sensitivity of the loss }J&#xa;\text{ to the pre-activation }z^{[l]}.&#xa;\end{aligned}&#xa;\)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
